# Real secret material and backend runtime env files - never needed to build
# the frontend/Caddy image (Dockerfile.caddy only ever COPYs client/ and
# deploy/Caddyfile), but sat in the build context anyway since this file
# didn't exist before. client/.env* is deliberately NOT excluded here: Vite
# reads it at build time for VITE_* values baked into the production bundle
# (e.g. VITE_INVITE_URL), so removing it would silently break the built app.
deploy/secrets
deploy/secrets-staging
deploy/.env.production
deploy/.env.staging
server/.env.development
